ier findings. The federal operating account finding came in fiscal 2025.", "t0": 54.26, "t1": 59.85, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Separate fiscal years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.87, 1.27, 1.66, 2.53, 2.68, 2.99, 3.41, 3.72, 4.11, 4.29, 4.37, 4.73, 4.98]}, {"scene": "prior", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The reports do not establish a final disallowance for the later finding.", "t0": 59.97, "t1": 63.14, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Final disallowance"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.54, 0.71, 0.91, 1.34, 1.43, 1.74, 2.3, 2.42, 2.52, 2.78]}, {"scene": "prior", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 63.26, "t1": 65.41, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"accounts": "Which account paid the debt?", "second": "A separate project", "prior": "Earlier reserve refunds"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "question"}